From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 16:59:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: serial: samsung: Add Apple T7000 UART
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The A8 and A8X UARTs have the sampling-factor field that the T8010
match data programs: on the iPad Air 2, writing (16 - f) << 16 | d to
UBRDIV gives 24 MHz / (f * (d + 1)) for f from 16 down to 4, so that
3 Mbaud is reachable for its Bluetooth UART with f = 8, d = 0. The
oversampling formula of the T8010 match data is the same, and the
register layout is otherwise the S5L one.

Add an apple,t7000-uart compatible with apple,t8010-uart and
apple,s5l-uart as fallbacks, so that A8/A8X UARTs get the T8010 baud
rate programming without a driver change.

Martin's version selects the mode with a board-level DT property,
apple,baud-factor-select, in ipad-nixos b94d42f
kernel/patches/0092-samsung-tty-apple-s5l-sampling-factor-baud.patch
(measurements in research/2026-10-11-uart3-register-capture.md,
rounds 8 and 9). The mode is a property of the UART block, so it is
selected by compatible here.

Reported-by: Martin Puškáč <martin@icebear.sk>
Signed-off-by: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/samsung_uart.yaml | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/samsung_uart.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/samsung_uart.yaml
index df763d5ae..806b60e21 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/samsung_uart.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/serial/samsung_uart.yaml
@@ -31,6 +31,10 @@ properties:
       - items:
           - const: apple,t8010-uart
           - const: apple,s5l-uart
+      - items:
+          - const: apple,t7000-uart
+          - const: apple,t8010-uart
+          - const: apple,s5l-uart
       - items:
           - const: samsung,exynos2200-uart
           - const: google,gs101-uart
